TASK2: subnet 2001:fd8:2f2::/48 into 32 offices
RivanSolution: CAI: Convert, Add, Ifingermo
convert to 2r_: 32 = 2r_5
add: /48 + /5 = /53, (8i, 2nd):
Ifingermo: 
2001:fd8:2f2:0000::/53
2001:fd8:2f2:0800::/53
2001:fd8:2f2:1000::/53
