---------------------------------------------------------------

3 RULES OF ROUTING
   1. PING DIKIT ALWAYS = if not pingable (physical error or wrong ip address)
   2. ROUTE NOT DIKIT = 
	route add 10.10.1.0 mask 255.255.255.0 10.3.3.1
   3. REMEMBER RULE 1 AND 2

5 WAYS TO ROUTE
- STATIC ROUTE - endpoint
- EIGRP - cisco brand
- OSPF - different brands
- BGP - 2 or more telco
- VPN

---------------------------------------------------------------

STATIC ROUTE

R3:
sh ip int brief | ex una
show ip router connected = kalye/network
show ip router connected | inc c

10.1.1.4/30
10.1.1.8/30
172.16.50.5/20
192.168.1.100/27

staticRoute:
ip route 10.1.1.4 255.255.255.252 null 0
ip route 10.1.1.8 255.255.255.252 null 0
ip route 172.16.48.5 255.255.240.0 null 0
ip route 192.168.1.96 255.255.255.224 null 0

