EIRGP

10.1.1.4/30
172.16.50.5/20
192.168.1.100/27

router eigrp 100
network 10.1.1.4 0.0.0.3
network 172.16.48.0 0.0.15.255
network 192.168.1.96 0.0.0.31

---------------------------------------------------------------

OSPF

10.1.1.4/30
172.16.50.5/20
192.168.1.100/27

router ospf 1
network 10.1.1.4 0.0.0.3 area 0
network 172.16.48.0 0.0.15.255 area 0
network 192.168.1.96 0.0.0.31 area 0

---------------------------------------------------------------

!HOW TO CHECK IF EIGRP IS WORKING PROPERLY:
SIR: show ip protocols
SIEN: show ip EIGRP neighbors --> super, meron kapitbahay
SIET: show ip eigrp topology --> super, madami ang P, P lahat
show ip eigrp traffic
show ip route eigrp

---------------------------------------------------------------

OSPF HEADER

ROUTER ID
AREA ID
SUBNET MASK
AUTHENTICATION TYPE

HELLO TIME: 10 secs
DEAD INTERVAL: 40 secs

BACKUP DESIGNATED ROUTER
DESIGNATED ROUTER

!HOW TO CHECK IF OSPF IS WORKING PROPERLY:
SIP: sh ip protocols
SION: sh ip ospf neighbor
SIOD: sh ip ospf database
SIRO: sh ip route ospf

